BEGIN_PGML
Let [`B = \{1, 3, 5, 7, 9\}\text{.}`]  Give an example of a set [`A`] containing [`3`] elements that is a subset of [`B\text{.}`]

[_]{$A1}{10}

What is [`A \cup B`] for the set [`A`] you gave as an example?

[_]{$B1}{20}

END_PGML

Section::End();

