BEGIN_PGML
Give an example of two distinct sets [`A`] and [`B`] such that [`A \cup B = B\text{.}`]

[`A = `] [_]{$twosets}{20}; [`B = `] [_]{$twosets}{20}

For the example you gave, is [`A \subseteq B\text{?}`]  [_]{$yes}{5}

END_PGML

Section::End();

